<title>UK: Volkswagen sets mark exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>Volkswagen sets mark exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VOLKSWAGEN INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  VOLKSWAGEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     1.75	MATURITY    15.JUL.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> PREMIUM    22 PCT    LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NOTES	EXCHANGEABLE INTO ORDINARY SHARES OF VOLKSWAGEN</p>
<p>		FROM 15.JUL.00 UNTIL 03.JUL.03</p>
<p>		CALL OPTION FROM 15.JUL.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
